`.\n- Data/hooks: `.../display/hooks/useNavigationMenuItemsData.ts`, `useSortedNavigationMenuItems.ts`, `.../common/hooks/useUpdateManyNavigationMenuItems.ts`.\n- `NavigationMenuItemType` enum: `packages/twenty-shared/src/types/NavigationMenuItemType.ts`.\n\n**Bureau representation:** in the app, not native nodes:\n- `packages/twenty-apps/internal/a2e-documents/src/navigation-menu-items/bureau-folder.navigation-menu-item.ts` — `defineNavigationMenuItem({ name: 'Bureau', type: FOLDER, position: 100, id ...0010-...0002 })`.\n- `.../navigation-menu-items/documents.navigation-menu-item.ts` — `name: 'Pages', type: LINK, link: '/bureau', folderUniversalIdentifier: bureauFolder`.\n- Host route `/bureau` → `packages/twenty-front/src/pages/bureau/BureauPage.tsx` → `packages/twenty-front/src/modules/bureau/components/BureauLanding.tsx` (new page, template links, recent pages).\n- The tree browser itself is opened via command menu: `.../command-menu-items/go-to-documents.command-menu-item.ts` (`frontComponentUniversalIdentifier: documentBrowser`).\n- Drift guard test: `.../lib/__tests__/bureau-navigation.test.ts` (asserts folder/LINK structure and `link === '/bureau'`).\n\n---\n\n## 9. Existing tests (style to match)\n\nApp (Node test runner, `node:assert/strict`, run via `node --test --experimental-strip-types \"src/lib/__tests__/*.test.ts\"`):\n- Tree component logic: `packages/twenty-apps/internal/a2e-documents/src/lib/__tests__/document-tree.test.ts` (move payloads, cycle rejection, `isDescendantOf`), `document-tree-keyboard.test.ts` (up/down/indent/outdent), `document-tree-loading.test.ts` (lazy paging/nesting/merge).\n- Copy/duplicate: `.../lib/__tests__/instantiate-template.test.ts`, `save-document-as-template.test.ts` (duplicate title/payload), `apply-template.test.ts` (idempotency no-duplicate), `record-note-copy.test.ts`.\n- Cycle guard: `.../lib/__tests__/document-cycle.test.ts` (includes cross-branch subtree relocation case, lines 350+).\n- No `.test.tsx`/`.spec.tsx` anywhere in `a2e-documents`; front-components are not component-tested — put US-157 logic in `src/lib/*.ts` and test there.\n\nHost (Jest, `@testing-library/react`):\n- Side-panel open hook: `packages/twenty-front/src/modules/side-panel/hooks/__tests__/useOpenRecordInSidePanel.test.tsx` (mocks `useNavigateSidePanel`, `useNavigateApp`, `useIsMobile`; wrapper `getJestMetadataAndApolloMocksAndCommandMenuWrapper`).\n- Front-component execution mapping: `packages/twenty-front/src/modules/front-components/hooks/__tests__/useFrontComponentExecutionContext.test.tsx` (mocks `useOpenRecordInSidePanel`, asserts `openRecordInSidePanel` args).\n- Search filter: `packages/twenty-front/src/utils/__tests__/filterBySearchQuery.test.ts`.\n- DnD: `packages/twenty-front/src/modules/ui/utilities/drag-and-drop/components/__tests__/DragDropItemSortableCell.test.tsx`, `.../sensors/__tests__/PointerSensorWithSourceGuard.test.ts`.\n- Bureau landing: `packages/twenty-front/src/modules/bureau/components/__tests__/BureauLanding.test.tsx`.\n\n---\n\n## Practical synthesis for US-157\n\n- **Sidebar tree** = `document-browser.front-component.tsx`; **in page** = `document-page.front-component.tsx` child list. Both must call the same pure builders/mutation shape (`updateDocument { parentId, position }`) — no second tree state.\n- **Move-to dialog**: new in-component overlay in the browser (and/or page), reusing `flattenNodes`/`nestTreeFromChildrenMap` + simple `.includes()` title filter (host's `filterBySearchQuery` is unavailable in the sandbox); action → existing `moveDocument`/`buildMoveDocumentPayload`.\n- **Duplicate page**: new pure lib helper that emits fresh content IDs via `buildTemplateCopyPayload`/`remapTemplateBlockIds` and recurses children; persist with `createDocuments`; add a fresh-IDs test.\n- **Copy link**: `copyToClipboard(buildDocumentDeepLink(id))` where the helper returns `/object/document/${id}`; add a test.\n- **Open in side panel**: reuse `openSidePanelPage({ page: SidePanelPages.ViewRecord, recordId, objectNameSingular: 'document' })` exactly as `document-page.front-component.tsx:130`.\n- **Keyboard alternatives (C7)**: keyboard move already exists in the browser via `buildKeyboardMovePayload`; extend to the move-to/duplicate/copy-link/open-in-panel actions and mirror them in the page child list.\n- **Tests**: lib `.test.ts` in `.../lib/__tests__/`; if any host change is genuinely required, host Jest specs under the relevant `modules/.../__tests__/`. Remember the app slice command: `yarn typecheck && yarn lint && yarn test:unit` (in `packages/twenty-apps/internal/a2e-documents`), and bump `0.2.12` once if the app is touched.\n</task_result>\n</task>"
